6) compact form: Brace^{ij} = [cos(2phi) delta^{ij} + sin(2phi) eps^{ij}] / (2 (z-w)^2), phi = angle from x-w to x-z,
   so R = (1/k+) P^i [cos2phi d^{ij} + sin2phi eps^{ij}] K^j(y-z) / (z-w)^2  -- manifestly regular on (x-z)^2=(x-w)^2
